        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Fusion SH-A2 Lever And 100-A2 Deadbolt </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique and modern shape of Fusion Hardware's entry set is inherently contemporary making it the perfect addition to any space with clean lines and a sleek appearance. The concealed mounting screws insure that the sophisticated design is left unmarred. Made for heavy duty security, this stainless steel deadbolt and lever entryset has a limited lifetime warranty. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It has an optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/modern-3030-stainless-steel-leverset-fusion-sh-a2\"><b>SH-A2 Stainless Steel Leverset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Stainless Steel SH-A2 Lever and 100-A2 Deadbolt Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" throw bolt with Interior roll pins.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass Schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Cycle tested to ANSI standards.</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly of leverset with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n<li>Includes passage function door leverset and single cylinder deadbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Stainless Steel SH-A2 Lever With 100-A2 Deadbolt Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b> is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while the <b>Passage Lever Set</b> latch operates from either side of door by using a spindle.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Stainless Steel Entryset, Fusion SH-A2/100-A2",
                "description": "Fusion Stainless Steel SH-A2 Lever With 100-A2 Deadbolt - The unique and modern shape of Fusion Hardware's entry set is inherently contemporary making it the perfect addition to any space with clean lines and a sleek appearance. The concealed mounting screws insure that the sophisticated design is left unmarred. Made for heavy duty security, this stainless steel deadbolt and lever entryset has a limited lifetime warranty. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
                "keywords": "FUS-SH-A2/100-A2 Contemporary Entry Lever Locks, Contemporary Stainless Steel Entry Lever Set with Deadbolts, Fusion 3030 contemporary stainless steel levers, Fusion 3000 Contemporary Stainless Steel Deadbolts, Fusion 3030 levers with 3000 deadbolt Entrysets, stainless steel Lever Lock Sets, south beach levers, Modern Stainless Steel SH-A2 Lever and 100-A2 Deabolt Sets,"
